It is well-known that  $$ h(m,n)=\begin{cases}mn&\text{(m and n are even)}m(n-1)&\text{(m is even and n is odd)}(m-1)n&\text{(m is odd and n is even)}(m-1)(n-1)+2&\text{(m and n are odd)}\end{cases} $$  Therefore,
\begin{align*}
\sum_{m=3}^6\sum_{n=3}^{12}h(m,n)&=\sum_{M=2}^3\sum_{N=2}^6(2M-1,2N-1)+h(2M,2N-1)+h(2M-1,2N)+h(2M,2N)
&=\sum_{M=2}^3\sum_{N=2}^6(2M-2)(2N-2)+2+2M(2N-2)+(2M-2)2N+4MN
&=\sum_{N=2}^6\sum_{M=2}^316MN-8M-8N+6
&=\sum_{N=2}^672N-34
&=\boxed{1270}
